WEBVTT

00:04:28.946 --> 00:04:30.715
How do you leverage that information?

00:04:30.739 --> 00:04:31.890
Let's get personal.

00:04:31.914 --> 00:04:35.121
I won't ask who here's had a colonoscopy,
but if you're over age 50,

00:04:35.145 --> 00:04:37.138
it's time for your screening colonoscopy.

00:04:37.162 --> 00:04:39.593
How'd you like to avoid
the pointy end of the stick?

00:04:39.617 --> 00:04:41.668
Now there's essentially
virtual colonoscopy.

00:04:41.692 --> 00:04:42.983
Compare those two pictures.

00:04:43.007 --> 00:04:46.274
As a radiologist, you can basically
fly through your patient's colon,

00:04:46.298 --> 00:04:48.593
and augmenting that
with artificial intelligence,

00:04:48.617 --> 00:04:51.246
potentially identify a lesion
that we might have missed,

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:52.846
but using AI on top of radiology,

00:04:52.870 --> 00:04:54.921
we can find lesions
that were missed before.

00:04:54.945 --> 00:04:57.472
Maybe this will encourage
people to get colonoscopies

00:04:57.496 --> 00:04:58.879
that wouldn't have otherwise.

00:04:58.903 --> 00:05:00.915
This is an example of this paradigm shift.